# Standing requests

Finish the item the user just named before starting another. If a new message arrives mid-task, keep the unfinished items on this list and do them in the same turn when they are small.

## Keep

- Location prompt has a Close control that only dismisses it. Body text uses muted `#5C4A62`. Titles use ink `#1A1028`.
- `--muted` stays `#5C4A62`. Do not let a component library replace it with a near-white token.
- UI text uses Inter, with SF Pro and Roboto only as fallbacks. Do not load Geist, Nunito, or DM Sans back in.
- Action buttons are the shared `Button`. They size to the label. They are 44px tall. They do not stretch across the page.
- People map markers stay as they are. Events, drops, and places are the sticker drawings with a tail, not pins or badges.
- Hero art (profile key, location compass, outside-Mumbai city) comes from `public/assets/app/`. Do not put those drawings back inside a circle or colored tile.

## Always

- Light UI. Brand pink `#D01265` with white text, teal `#00987F` and orange `#E45700` with ink text.
- Verify a UI change in the running app before calling it done.
- When a product change is finished, commit only that change, push `master`, and rebuild. Do not print the server address or any secret.
